upernatants were transferred to new LowBind Eppendorf tubes, and 20 µL carboxylate beads were added to increase peptide recovery. Then, beads were combined and washed twice with 100% ACN. Peptides were eluted by using first 20 µL 2% DMSO, followed by a second step with 20 µL Millipore H2O. Purified peptides were vacuum dried, and pellets were suspended in 40 µL 0.1% formic acid (FA) and transferred to HPLC vials.\n'}], 'model': 'gpt-5.4-nano-2026-03-17', 'store': True, 'temperature': 0.3}}
